OpenYield Fusion
Copyright 2026 the OpenYield Fusion contributors.

This product includes software developed as part of OpenYield
(https://github.com/ShenShan123/OpenYield), licensed under Apache-2.0.

The experiment execution and result analysis core comes from the collaboration
branch https://github.com/Weize-Lin/OpenYield. The integrated workbench calls
the current checkout through evaluation API version 1. Shared suite replay and
execution orchestration have been extended; algorithm strategies, device models
and failure criteria are preserved. Git history records both contributors.

The existing demo bundles were historically generated with commit
312f137e9ab960f1178f4991d9bf4675575e2f01. Their records and original attribution
are retained, and are not relabelled as current-checkout simulation results.

Fusion adds the web workbench, multi-circuit suite orchestration,
evidence/dataset endpoints, demo bundling, tests and documentation.
See README.md and INTEGRATION_REPORT.md for scope and verification limits.
